{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Too Many Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some games have enemy waves. This game has enemy tsunamis. The undead come in overwhelming numbers, flooding the screen. Survival is possible, but chances are slim.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/HugeHordes2.gif?t=1741772345\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Mining</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between major battles, you explore procedurally generated mines for gold and upgrades. But it's no time for relaxation, there's undead here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ExploreMines.gif?t=1741772345\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Objective</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive long enough to defeat the Evil Skullhead and put an end to his mockery forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/EvilSkullOverlord.gif?t=1741772345\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566790?t=1741772345","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566790?t=1741772345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/3b8db287b24aa92202e77dba965c2f70af364ac1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741772345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/3b8db287b24aa92202e77dba965c2f70af364ac1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741772345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p